cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models or scripts, please cite the paper and OpenKeito as below."
type: software
title: "IEEE 39-bus system with a WECC generic PV plant, from CIM to OpenKeito"
abstract: >-
  Converter from the emthub CIM of the IEEE 39-bus test system to OpenKeito models, the generated models,
  and the scripts that run them with OpenKeito and make the IEEE 39-bus figures and tables of the paper
  "OpenKeito: An Open Electromagnetic Transient Simulator for People and AI Agents That Starts From
  Power-Flow and CIM Data".
authors:
